WEBVTT

00:06.640 --> 00:09.500
Move out! Strike!

00:23.120 --> 00:28.500
By imperial order, we are seizing stolen grain! Anyone who resists will be executed on the spot! Search the premises!

00:45.200 --> 00:48.200
A rabble of thugs... I never imagined they would yield so easily.

00:48.240 --> 00:51.500
Doesn't it strike you that things went a little too smoothly?

00:54.880 --> 00:59.500
Report! No grain was found in the storehouse—it is entirely filled with illicit weapons and armor! What?!

01:10.920 --> 01:15.500
Report! A detachment of elite troops is closing in upon our perimeter!

01:16.240 --> 01:20.200
Elite troops? Besides the city garrison, where could another army come from?!

01:20.200 --> 01:23.000
I saw the banner—it bears the insignia of the 'Zu' clan!

01:23.640 --> 01:27.500
The northern frontier army! We've walked straight into a trap! Fall back!

01:32.400 --> 01:37.500
Unfilial creature! That rebellious son—is he so impatient to seize the throne?!

01:38.160 --> 01:46.800
Your Majesty, the capital is in mortal peril! Your subject petitions that frontier troops be dispatched immediately to crush the treasonous faction!

01:47.200 --> 01:54.200
Right! Zu Kun has returned to court to report; Zhen's frontier army is stationed nearby!

01:54.640 --> 01:59.500
Who was commanding the vanguard? General Fenwei, Zu Yue!

02:00.440 --> 02:02.500
Retreat! Fall back!

02:14.400 --> 02:22.500
The Prince of Jin has committed treason! I am commanded to take you into custody! Surrender your arms and your lives shall be spared!

02:23.880 --> 02:27.500
I grant you three breaths—drop your weapons!

02:29.440 --> 02:30.000
Three!

02:34.160 --> 02:38.200
Your Highness, the depot is packed with armor and weapons! Let us hack our way out!

02:38.600 --> 02:39.500
Two!
